  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「ふふ～ん♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「どうよ！　まりあの代理なんて、あたしには朝飯前なんだからっ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 20,
    "dress": "old-sister",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sister_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「そうよっ！　こちとらオギャアと生まれた赤ちゃんのころから、まりあの近くにいたんだから！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「『まりあっぽい振る舞い』ぐらい、お茶の子さいさいで再現できるのよ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「ちっちゃいころは、教会のお仕事を手伝ったりもしてたしね～。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 20,
    "dress": "old-sister",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sister_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「むしろ懐かしいわっ、何だか楽しくなってきちゃった……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 20,
    "dress": "old-sister",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sister_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「……あ痛っ!?　う～、そういえば怪我してたんだった。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 20,
    "dress": "old-sister",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sister_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "「あんまり浮かれてちゃいけないわね、無理しない程度にがんばろ～っと♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "（とりあえず、最大の難関であるミサはどうにか乗り越えたし。まぁ、一安心ってところね？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "（お祈りの作法とか、けっこう覚えてるものね。まぁ、あたしは優秀だから当然だけどね！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 20,
    "dress": "old-sister",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sister_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "（でも、さすがにちょっと疲れたわ……。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "（高齢者のかたとか、ガキんちょどもの相手をするのって大変ね？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 20,
    "dress": "old-sister",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sister_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "（高齢者のかたは、まだいいけど。おじいちゃんおばあちゃん、嫌いじゃないし。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "（わかんないとこ、教えてもらったりとか……♪）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "（けっこう、あたしのこと覚えてるひともいて。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "（『久しぶりだねぇ梅ちゃん、おおきくなったね』な～んて言われたりとか。ちょっと嬉しかったなぁ～♪）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 20,
    "dress": "old-sister",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sister_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "（問題だったのは、ガキんちょどもよ。聖書を読んであげたり、一緒に歌ったりするだけなのに！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "（まったく言うこと聞かないんだもん、あぁ腹立つ！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "（やたら抱きついてきて、鬱陶しかったし。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "（髪の毛とか引っぱられたし～、尻とか胸とか触られたし！　やんなっちゃう！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 20,
    "dress": "old-sister",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sister_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "（でも、悔しいことに愛らしいのよね。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "（クッキー配ったら、ちっちゃなお手々をのばして『ちょうだい、ちょうだい』って……♪）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "（あたしも子供のころは、まりあとふたりで同じことしてたわね）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "（クッキーをとりあって、いつも喧嘩して……。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 20,
    "dress": "old-sister",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sister_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "（まりあ、すぐ泣くんだもん。けっきょく、ぜんぶクッキーあげちゃうことになるんだわ？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 20,
    "dress": "old-sister",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sister_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "（いつもそうよ、あいつは。ずるいのよ、ふんだっ！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 20,
    "dress": "old-sister",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sister_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "（……まりあ、大丈夫かしら？　ちゃんと、おとなしくしてるわよね？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "（薬だけ飲ませて、寝かしつけたけど。あいつ、素直で従順に見えてときどき頑固なんだもん）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "（昔っからあいつ、あたしの言うこと聞かないんだからっ！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 20,
    "dress": "old-sister",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-sister_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "（よからぬ動きをしてないか、注意深く見守っておかなきゃ！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "（そうよ、決して心配なわけじゃないのよ！）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "（ミサの後片づけとかはおいといて、まりあの様子を確認し……うん？）"
  },
  {
